WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.638
It's Career Day.

2
00:00:05.639 --> 00:00:10.528
My class is learning about different jobs.

3
00:00:10.529 --> 00:00:14.497
Miss Wilson is a chef.

4
00:00:14.498 --> 00:00:17.922
She cooks delicious meals.

5
00:00:17.923 --> 00:00:21.274
She works at a restaurant.

6
00:00:21.275 --> 00:00:25.823
Mr. Smith is a photographer.

7
00:00:25.824 --> 00:00:29.289
He takes pictures of babies.

8
00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:32.816
He works at a studio.

9
00:00:32.817 --> 00:00:37.261
Mr. Lewis is a car designer.

10
00:00:37.262 --> 00:00:40.124
He designs cars.

11
00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:43.784
He works at a car company.

12
00:00:43.785 --> 00:00:48.159
Dr. White is a dentist.

13
00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:51.190
She checks people's teeth.

14
00:00:51.191 --> 00:00:55.258
She works at a dentist's office.

15
00:00:55.259 --> 00:00:59.467
Mrs. Jones is a vet.

16
00:00:59.468 --> 00:01:03.153
She takes care of sick animals.

17
00:01:03.154 --> 00:01:07.116
She works at an animal hospital.

18
00:01:07.117 --> 00:01:11.534
Professor Allen is a scientist.

19
00:01:11.535 --> 00:01:14.545
He studies science.

20
00:01:14.546 --> 00:01:21.527
He works at a university.

21
00:01:21.528 --> 00:01:23.605
Career Day is fun!

22
00:01:23.606 --> 00:01:27.089
There are lots of fun jobs.

23
00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:34.183
What do you want to be when you grow up?

